title: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › The tab
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=actions
intro: The layout of the first tab: the cards on the left, the five buttons and the decision log on the right, and when each button is on or off. Each card and each button has its own diagram.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Recommended actions'"
screen at "Recommended actions\nCards on the left, side panel on the right"
process in "Intro line\n'Each card shows what the agents will add to the draft and how much it tends to help. Applied together, they take the chance from 62% to 88%.'"

group gL "Left: the cards"
  screen oc "Open cards\nOne card per recommendation that is not yet applied or dismissed"
  screen ap "'Applied (6)' (only when something is applied)\nOne line each with a green tick and '+11 pts · applied'\nClick a line to open its bullets"
  screen dm "'Dismissed (1)' (only when something is dismissed)\nTitle struck through, 'Reason logged: ...', 'Bring back'"
  toast ban "Banner 'Every recommendation is applied'\n'The draft is up to date. Open the Draft tab to read it, or send it to the payer.'"
endgroup

group gR "Right: the side panel"
  process cnt "Count line\n'6 of 6 recommendations will be included in the draft.'\nWhen none are open: 'No open recommendations. Applied ones are listed on the left.'"
  click b1 "Click 'Apply selected (6)'"
  click b2 "Click 'Send to payer'"
  click b3 "Click 'Refine recommendations'"
  click b4 "Click 'Add clinical context'"
  click b5 "Click 'Dismiss recommendations'"
  screen lg "'Logged decisions'\nNewest six entries, each with the time"
endgroup

process off "Why a button is off\nApply and Dismiss: no card is included\nSend to payer: checks open, or the request is not sendable\nAll five: while the agents are updating the draft"
click tk "Click a card's checkbox or title to leave it out or put it back"
process up "Count line and 'Apply selected (N)' follow\nNothing is logged"
decision dAll "Is anything open?"
decision dApp "Is anything applied?"

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › One card"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Apply selected"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Send to payer and review and sign"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Refine and add clinical context"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back"

s1 --> at --> in
at --> dAll
dAll -->|Yes| oc --> g1
dAll -->|No| dApp
dApp -->|Yes| ban
dApp -->|No| cnt
at --> ap
at --> dm
at --> cnt
oc --> tk --> up --> cnt
cnt --> b1 --> g2
cnt --> b2 --> g3
cnt --> b3 --> g4
cnt --> b4 --> g4
cnt --> b5 --> g5
cnt --> off
at --> lg
